2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] • BASIC Implementation:*
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Written by Wozniak in Integer BASIC (Apple's first BASIC)
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Uses PEEK/POKE for graphics manipulation
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Leverages Apple II's lo-res graphics (40×48)
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Demonstrates Woz's clever optimization even in BASIC
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] • Notable Features:*
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Graphics drawn using PLOT and HLIN/VLIN
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Collision detection via screen memory checking
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Sound effects with simple timing loops
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] - Compact game logic in BASIC
2026-03-10 07:57:48 [deepseek-chat] 
