2026-03-10 10:00:27 [claude-opus-4-6] Notes
2026-03-10 10:00:27 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:00:27 [claude-opus-4-6] - Paddle analog values can be noisy — averaging a few reads helps.
2026-03-10 10:00:27 [claude-opus-4-6] - The analog values update continuously via the VIC chip's internal sampling.
2026-03-10 10:00:27 [claude-opus-4-6] - Since buttons share joystick lines, you can't reliably use both simultaneously.
2026-03-10 10:00:27 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:04:18 [nitro@ryzen5] paddle 1 button is bit 4 but paddle 2 is not showing
