2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] If it returns 128, that bit is set as output. Clear it:
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] POKE 37154, PEEK(37154) AND 127
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:15:42 [claude-opus-4-6] Then try reading the button again. Does that fix it?
