2026-03-10 10:16:19 [claude-opus-4-6] 20 GOTO 10
2026-03-10 10:16:19 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:16:19 [claude-opus-4-6] 
2026-03-10 10:16:19 [claude-opus-4-6] Press the button and see which value changes — that'll tell us exactly where it's mapped.
