2026-03-12 08:08:15 [grok-4.20-beta] • Drive.*
2026-03-12 08:08:15 [grok-4.20-beta] 
2026-03-12 08:08:15 [grok-4.20-beta] 500m is only a 5–7 minute walk, but you need the car at the carwash. Walking there would
2026-03-12 08:08:15 [grok-4.20-beta] leave your dirty car at home, so you'd still have to come back and drive it anyway.
2026-03-12 08:08:15 [grok-4.20-beta] 
2026-03-12 08:08:15 [grok-4.20-beta] Just drive the car there – it's the only option that actually gets the job done.
