2026-03-29 18:41:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] the new XIP cache are active disrupts flash execution and leads to a hard fault. Additionally, the
2026-03-29 18:41:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] register layout and safe-access requirements have changed.
