2026-03-29 19:49:27 [gemini-3.1-pro] You can easily free up 7 instructions by folding your `nop` delays into the delay slots `[ ... ]`
2026-03-29 19:49:27 [gemini-3.1-pro] of your `jmp` and `set` instructions.
