2026-03-29 19:49:27 [gemini-3.1-pro] Every PIO instruction can hold a delay of up to 31 cycles. For example, `nop [30]` followed by `jmp
2026-03-29 19:49:27 [gemini-3.1-pro] y--, loop` takes 32 cycles total. You can replace this entirely with `jmp y--, loop [31]`, which
2026-03-29 19:49:27 [gemini-3.1-pro] also takes exactly 32 cycles but saves an instruction.
2026-03-29 19:49:27 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
