2026-03-29 20:15:22 [gemini-3.1-pro] those bytes from the TX FIFO using `out` instructions to shift the pixel data to the pins,
2026-03-29 20:15:22 [gemini-3.1-pro] replacing the hardcoded `set` toggles.
