2026-03-29 20:42:38 [gemini-3.1-pro] Yes, we can feed the FIFO continuously with a fast Xorshift32 random number generator. Since the
2026-03-29 20:42:38 [gemini-3.1-pro] PIO will consume 32 bits very quickly, we must remove the `sleep_ms(250)` from your main loop so
2026-03-29 20:42:38 [gemini-3.1-pro] the CPU can keep the TX FIFO topped up.
