2026-03-29 20:42:38 [gemini-3.1-pro] Here is a reusable noise generator and the updated main loop:
2026-03-29 20:42:38 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] uint32_t generateNoise(uint32_t state) {
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 	state ^= state << 13;
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 	state ^= state >> 17;
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 	state ^= state << 5;
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 	return state ? state : 1; // Prevent locking up on zero
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] }
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] Replace your `while (!ReadBootSel())` loop in `main()` with this non-blocking version:
2026-03-29 20:42:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
