2026-03-30 10:08:24 [gemini-3.1-pro] the required half-line shift for the second field. Uncommenting this should instruct the TV to
2026-03-30 10:08:24 [gemini-3.1-pro] weave the fields into a 576-line display.
2026-03-30 10:08:24 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-30 10:08:24 [gemini-3.1-pro] While the image will be flicker-free, keep in mind that TV deinterlacers can sometimes introduce a
