2026-03-30 11:39:13 [claude-opus-4-6] Same file, no changes. Good to hear it survives TV power cycling - that confirms the sync timing is
2026-03-30 11:39:13 [claude-opus-4-6] robust enough for the TV's acquisition window to lock reliably from cold.
