2026-03-31 19:37:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] Here is the updated `vidblit.pio` with the timing cycles recalculated for exactly 148.5 MHz.
2026-03-31 19:37:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-31 19:37:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] A PAL line at 148.5 MHz requires exactly 9,504 cycles (64 µs). The active video loop remains
2026-03-31 19:37:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] exactly 7,744 cycles (704 pixels × 11 cycles), plus 3 cycles of setup. The blanking periods have
2026-03-31 19:37:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] been adjusted to consume the remaining 1,757 cycles while maintaining accurate PAL sync
2026-03-31 19:37:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] proportions.
