2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] Currently, the code executes the tools, pushes the tool results to `rohaHistory`, and then
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] pushes the assistant's message (which contains the `tool_calls` array) to the history.
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
