2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] conversation history where the tool's answer appears before the assistant's request to use that
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] tool.
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] Strict APIs, including Gemini and OpenAI, enforce a linear conversational timeline. They expect the
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] assistant's message initiating the tool call to appear immediately before the tool messages
2026-04-01 08:23:17 [gemini-3.1-pro] providing the results. If the order is inverted, the API will likely reject the request with a 400
