2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] There is one small side effect to be aware of while you run your tests:
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] 				if(content && validCallResult){
