2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] If `validCallResult` is `false`, this prevents the `assistant` message from being added to
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] `rohaHistory`. However, the code immediately below this block still runs `processToolCalls(calls)`
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] and pushes the `role: "tool"` results to the history.
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] This will leave "dangling" tool results in your conversation history (tool responses without a
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] preceding assistant tool call). Most LLM providers will reject the next prompt with a `400 Bad
2026-04-01 09:04:59 [gemini-3.1-pro] Request` if the history sequence is broken this way.
